  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have found that in certain worlds (both updated with SDK 2.0 and Udon for worlds) while I activate a blend tree with bone transforms involved, that FBT players are frozen in place until I close down the blend tree. Regular VR players and desktop users are unaffected.\nPeople also see me as frozen, with the bone transforms only visible from my point of view. Visemes work for everyone. The avatar has been updated using the latest SDK 3.0 for avatars, the blend tree is on the FX layer, and uses bones that are not part of the human skeleton.\nI am not sure what causes this, as it's a per-base issue depending on the world.",
